<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0,viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Venym Labs — Investor Deck 2026 v4</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600;700;800;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*,*::before,*::after{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#050505;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;color:#fff;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
::selection{background:#fff;color:#000}
::-webkit-scrollbar{width:0;display:none}

/* NOISE */
.noise{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:9999;opacity:.03;background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.65' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E")}

/* VIEWPORT + SLIDER */
.viewport{width:100%;height:100vh;overflow:hidden;position:relative}
.slider{display:flex;height:100%;transition:transform .6s cubic-bezier(.77,0,.175,1);will-change:transform}
.slide{flex:0 0 auto;height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}

/* PROGRESS BAR */
.progress{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;height:2px;background:#fff;z-index:100;transition:width .6s cubic-bezier(.77,0,.175,1)}

/* NAV DOTS */
.dots{position:fixed;right:24px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;z-index:100}
.dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);cursor:pointer;transition:all .3s}
.dot.active{background:rgba(255,255,255,.4);transform:scale(1.3)}

/* SLIDE COUNTER */
.counter{position:fixed;bottom:24px;left:24px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.15em;color:#27272a;z-index:100}

/* BLOBS */
@keyframes blobFloat{0%,100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:.03}50%{transform:scale(1.1);opacity:.06}}
.blob{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;filter:blur(100px)}
.b1{top:-15%;left:-10%;width:50%;height:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);animation:blobFloat 15s ease-in-out infinite}
.b2{bottom:-20%;right:-10%;width:60%;height:60%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);animation:blobFloat 18s ease-in-out infinite 3s}

/* TYPE */
.mono{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}
.lbl{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.4em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#27272a}
.lbl2{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.5em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#52525b}
.hd{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:.88}
.hd2{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:.92}
.bd{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-weight:300;color:#a1a1aa;line-height:1.7}
.mu{color:#52525b}
.dm{color:#27272a}

/* INNER CONTAINER */
.w{position:relative;z-index:10;width:100%;max-width:900px;padding:80px 48px}

/* BADGES */
.tg{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 8px;border:1px solid;display:inline-block}
.tg-g{border-color:rgba(34,197,94,.2);color:rgba(34,197,94,.6);background:rgba(34,197,94,.05)}
.tg-y{border-color:rgba(234,179,8,.2);color:rgba(234,179,8,.6);background:rgba(234,179,8,.05)}
.tg-b{border-color:rgba(59,130,246,.2);color:rgba(59,130,246,.6);background:rgba(59,130,246,.05)}
.tg-w{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.08);color:#a1a1aa;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03)}
.tg-p{border-color:rgba(168,85,247,.2);color:rgba(168,85,247,.6);background:rgba(168,85,247,.05)}

/* CARDS */
.crd{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);transition:border-color .5s;overflow:hidden}
.crd:hover{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.1)}

/* METRIC STRIP */
.metric-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}
.metric-box{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);padding:20px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03)}
.metric-label{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#27272a;margin-bottom:8px}
.metric-value{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(18px,2.5vw,28px);color:#e4e4e7;letter-spacing:-.02em}

/* PIPELINE */
.pipe{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);padding:16px 20px}
.pipe-track{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:4px;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}
.pipe-n{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;white-space:nowrap;padding:5px 12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);color:#a1a1aa}
.pipe-a{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;color:#27272a;white-space:nowrap}

/* PILLS */
.pill{background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);padding:6px 14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.pill-d{width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08)}

/* BUTTONS */
.btn-row{display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn-p{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.25em;text-transform:uppercase;background:#fff;color:#000;padding:14px 32px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;border:none;cursor:pointer;transition:opacity .3s}
.btn-p:hover{opacity:.85}
.btn-s{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.25em;text-transform:uppercase;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);color:#a1a1aa;padding:14px 32px;cursor:pointer;display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;background:transparent;transition:border-color .3s}
.btn-s:hover{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.2)}

/* COMPARISON COLS */
.compare{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}
.compare-col{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);padding:24px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03)}
.compare-col.dim{opacity:.5}
.compare-col h4{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#27272a;margin-bottom:16px}
.compare-col ul{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.compare-col li{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:300;color:#a1a1aa;line-height:1.5;padding-left:16px;position:relative}
.compare-col li::before{content:'—';position:absolute;left:0;color:#27272a}

/* PRODUCT GRID */
.prod-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
.prod-grid .prod-item{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);padding:20px;transition:border-color .5s}
.prod-grid .prod-item:hover{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.1)}

/* AGENT CARDS */
.agent-cards{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.agent-card{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr 160px;gap:1px}
.agent-card>div{padding:16px 20px}
.agent-card>div:not(:last-child){border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05)}
.agent-hdr{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:8px;color:#27272a;margin-bottom:6px}
.agent-name{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#e4e4e7}

/* FRAME LINES + CORNERS */
.frame{position:absolute;inset:40px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.04);pointer-events:none;z-index:1}
.corners{position:absolute;inset:24px;pointer-events:none;z-index:2}
.corner{position:absolute;width:20px;height:20px}
.corner::before,.corner::after{content:'';position:absolute;background:rgba(255,255,255,.15)}
.corner-tl{top:0;left:0}
.corner-tl::before{top:0;left:0;width:20px;height:1px}
.corner-tl::after{top:0;left:0;width:1px;height:20px}
.corner-tr{top:0;right:0}
.corner-tr::before{top:0;right:0;width:20px;height:1px}
.corner-tr::after{top:0;right:0;width:1px;height:20px}
.corner-bl{bottom:0;left:0}
.corner-bl::before{bottom:0;left:0;width:20px;height:1px}
.corner-bl::after{bottom:0;left:0;width:1px;height:20px}
.corner-br{bottom:0;right:0}
.corner-br::before{bottom:0;right:0;width:20px;height:1px}
.corner-br::after{bottom:0;right:0;width:1px;height:20px}

/* DASH LIST */
.dash-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
.dash-item{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start}
.dash-item span:first-child{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:14px;color:#27272a;line-height:1.6;flex-shrink:0}
.dash-item span:last-child{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-weight:300;color:#a1a1aa;line-height:1.7}

/* RESPONSIVE */
@media(max-width:768px){
  .w{padding:48px 20px}
  .slide{align-items:flex-start}
  .metric-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .compare{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .compare-col.dim{opacity:.7}
  .prod-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .agent-card{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .agent-card>div:not(:last-child){border-right:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05)}
  .btn-row{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}
  .btn-row .btn-p,.btn-row .btn-s{padding:14px 20px;text-align:center;letter-spacing:.15em;width:100%;display:block}
  .dots{right:12px;gap:6px}
  .dot{width:5px;height:5px}
  .frame{inset:20px}
  .corners{inset:12px}
  .corner{width:14px;height:14px}
}
@media(max-width:480px){
  .w{padding:40px 16px}
  .lbl{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.3em}
  .tg{font-size:7px;padding:2px 6px}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .slider{transition:transform .2s ease}
  *{animation-duration:.01ms!important;transition-duration:.2s!important}
  .noise{display:none}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="noise"></div>
<div class="progress" id="progress"></div>
<div class="dots" id="dots"></div>
<div class="counter" id="counter">01 / 10</div>

<div class="viewport" id="viewport">
<div class="slider" id="slider">

<!-- ═══ SLIDE 01: THE HOOK ═══ -->
<div class="slide" data-idx="0">
  <div class="w" style="text-align:center;max-width:800px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:100%">
    <h1 class="hd" style="font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,56px);margin-bottom:32px">
      The best AI<br>doesn't come from<br><span class="mu">the biggest companies.</span>
    </h1>
    <div style="width:48px;height:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);margin-bottom:24px"></div>
    <div class="mono" style="font-size:10px;color:#52525b;line-height:1.7">
      OpenAI builds for everyone.<br>We build for you.
    </div>
    <div class="lbl" style="position:absolute;bottom:80px;left:48px">VENYM LABS</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ═══ SLIDE 02: THE PROBLEM ═══ -->
<div class="slide" data-idx="1">
  <div class="blob b1"></div><div class="blob b2"></div>
  <div class="frame"></div>
  <div class="corners">
    <div class="corner corner-tl"></div><div class="corner corner-tr"></div>
    <div class="corner corner-bl"></div><div class="corner corner-br"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="w">
    <div class="lbl" style="margin-bottom:40px">THE PROBLEM</div>
    <h2 class="hd" style="font-size:clamp(24px,3.8vw,44px);color:#e4e4e7;margin-bottom:24px">AI stops at screens.<br><span class="mu">The real world doesn't.</span></h2>
    <p class="bd" style="font-size:clamp(14px,1.4vw,17px);margin-bottom:40px;max-width:620px">
      Every major AI company is building for the digital layer. Chat interfaces, API calls, software tools. Meanwhile the physical world — manufacturing, logistics, drones, robotics — runs on intelligence that hasn't changed in decades.
    </p>
    <div class="dash-list">
      <div class="dash-item"><span>—</span><span>Enterprise AI spending will hit $1.5 trillion in 2025 — Gartner. Almost all of it targets software. The gap between digital AI and physical AI is the largest undisrupted market in technology.</span></div>
      <div class="dash-item"><span>—</span><span>Companies building physical products — drones, robots, autonomous systems — are forced to bolt on AI as an afterthought. There is no unified intelligence layer for the physical world.</span></div>
      <div class="dash-item"><span>—</span><span>The companies best positioned to build this layer are the ones who already ship AI products that work. Not research labs. Not chatbot companies. Builders.</span></div>
      <div class="dash-item"><span>—</span><span>The window to own the physical intelligence layer is open right now. First-mover advantage in autonomous systems compounds fast.</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="mono" style="font-size:10px;color:#a1a1aa;font-style:italic;margin-top:40px">"The next $10T market isn't another chatbot. It's intelligence that moves."</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ═══ SLIDE 03: WHAT WE BUILD ═══ -->
<div class="slide" data-idx="2">
  <div class="blob b1"></div><div class="blob b2"></div>
  <div class="frame"></div>
  <div class="corners">
    <div class="corner corner-tl"></div><div class="corner corner-tr"></div>
    <div class="corner corner-bl"></div><div class="corner corner-br"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="w">
    <div class="lbl" style="margin-bottom:40px">PRODUCTS</div>
    <h2 class="hd" style="font-size:clamp(24px,3.8vw,44px);color:#e4e4e7;margin-bottom:24px">Five products.<br><span class="mu">All live. All revenue.</span></h2>
    <p class="bd" style="font-size:clamp(14px,1.4vw,17px);margin-bottom:32px;max-width:620px">
      Not a roadmap. A product line. Every vertical ships real revenue.
    </p>
    <div class="prod-grid" style="margin-bottom:24px">
      <div class="prod-item">
        <div class="agent-hdr" style="margin-bottom:8px">SEARCH API</div>
        <div style="font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:#e4e4e7;margin-bottom:12px;letter-spacing:.04em">SearchHive</div>
        <ul style="list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
          <li style="font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:300;color:#a1a1aa;line-height:1.5;padding-left:14px;position:relative"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:#27272a">—</span>Millions of queries processed</li>
          <li style="font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:300;color:#a1a1aa;line-height:1.5;padding-left:14px;position:relative"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:#27272a">—</span>1,000+ registered developers</li>
          <li style="font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:300;color:#a1a1aa;line-height:1.5;padding-left:14px;position:relative"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:#27272a">—</span>Undercuts every major search API on price</li>
          <li style="font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:300;color:#a1a1aa;line-height:1.5;padding-left:14px;position:relative"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:#27272a">—</span><span class="tg tg-g">LIVE · REVENUE</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="prod-item">
        <div class="agent-hdr" style="margin-bottom:8px">DEX PROTOCOL</div>
        <div style="font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:#e4e4e7;margin-bottom:12px;letter-spacing:.04em">Hyperswap</div>
        <ul style="list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
          <li style="font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:300;color:#a1a1aa;line-height:1.5;padding-left:14px;position:relative"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:#27272a">—</span>$10M+ trading volume</li>
          <li style="font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:300;color:#a1a1aa;line-height:1.5;padding-left:14px;position:relative"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:#27272a">—</span>ML-powered swap routing</li>
          <li style="font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:300;color:#a1a1aa;line-height:1.5;padding-left:14px;position:relative"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:#27272a">—</span>Real-time market data ingestion</li>
          <li style="font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:300;color:#a1a1aa;line-height:1.5;padding-left:14px;position:relative"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:#27272a">—</span><span class="tg tg-g">LIVE · REVENUE</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="prod-item">
        <div class="agent-hdr" style="margin-bottom:8px">PERP EXECUTION</div>
        <div style="font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:#e4e4e7;margin-bottom:12px;letter-spacing:.04em">TIDE Protocol</div>
        <ul style="list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
          <li style="font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:300;color:#a1a1aa;line-height:1.5;padding-left:14px;position:relative"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:#27272a">—</span>$10M+ volume processed</li>
          <li style="font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:300;color:#a1a1aa;line-height:1.5;padding-left:14px;position:relative"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:#27272a">—</span>ML-powered execution layer</li>
          <li style="font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:300;color:#a1a1aa;line-height:1.5;padding-left:14px;position:relative"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:#27272a">—</span>Intent-based perp routing</li>
          <li style="font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:300;color:#a1a1aa;line-height:1.5;padding-left:14px;position:relative"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:#27272a">—</span><span class="tg tg-g">LIVE · REVENUE</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:24px">
      <div class="pill"><span class="pill-d"></span><span class="mono" style="font-size:10px;color:#a1a1aa;white-space:nowrap">CUSTOM AI — 100+ DELIVERED</span></div>
      <div class="pill"><span class="pill-d"></span><span class="mono" style="font-size:10px;color:#a1a1aa;white-space:nowrap">WORKFLOW AUTOMATION — LIVE</span></div>
      <div class="pill"><span class="pill-d"></span><span class="mono" style="font-size:10px;color:#a1a1aa;white-space:nowrap">PRIVATE EDGE — SHIPPED</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="mono" style="font-size:10px;color:#52525b;font-style:italic">"Every product listed is deployed and generating revenue. Not a prototype. Not a waitlist."</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ═══ SLIDE 04: BUSINESS MODEL ═══ -->
<div class="slide" data-idx="3">
  <div class="blob b1"></div><div class="blob b2"></div>
  <div class="frame"></div>
  <div class="corners">
    <div class="corner corner-tl"></div><div class="corner corner-tr"></div>
    <div class="corner corner-bl"></div><div class="corner corner-br"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="w">
    <div class="lbl" style="margin-bottom:40px">BUSINESS MODEL</div>
    <h2 class="hd" style="font-size:clamp(24px,3.8vw,44px);color:#e4e4e7;margin-bottom:24px">Revenue is not theoretical.</h2>
    <p class="bd" style="font-size:clamp(14px,1.4vw,17px);margin-bottom:32px;max-width:620px">
      Multiple revenue streams. No single point of failure. Every product monetizes differently.
    </p>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px">
      <div class="compare-col" style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);padding:24px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03)">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:16px">
          <h4 style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#27272a;margin-bottom:0">SearchHive — SaaS</h4>
          <span class="tg tg-g">RECURRING</span>
        </div>
        <p class="bd" style="font-size:13px">Per-query pricing that is below every major search API competitor. Developer subscriptions. Enterprise contracts. The closest product to earning millions. Predictable, scalable, compounding.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="compare-col" style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);padding:24px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03)">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:16px">
          <h4 style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#27272a;margin-bottom:0">Hyperswap + TIDE — DeFi</h4>
          <span class="tg tg-b">VOLUME-SCALED</span>
        </div>
        <p class="bd" style="font-size:13px">Swap fees on $20M+ combined volume across both protocols. ML algorithms optimize routing in real-time. Revenue scales directly with volume and market activity.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="compare-col" style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);padding:24px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03)">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:16px">
          <h4 style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#27272a;margin-bottom:0">Enterprise AI — Retainer</h4>
          <span class="tg tg-y">HIGH-MARGIN</span>
